    subgraph RTL[DUT - synthesizable coherent cache subsystem]
      DUT0[Cache 0]
      BUS[Coherence fabric + AXI4-style adapter]
      DUT1[Cache 1]
      DUT0 <--> BUS
      DUT1 <--> BUS
    end
    AG0 <-->|CPU 0 interface| DUT0
    AG1 <-->|CPU 1 interface| DUT1
